This "Appendix" folder contains additional scripts that were not part of the submitted paper, written afterwards following suggestions by coauthors/readers.
These scripts perform additional analyses on the same datasets as the paper.

Appendix_Script_01: broadly analyses the phenology of 3 microplankton genera (Alexandrium, Protoperidinium and Pseudo-nitzschia) to offer a comparison with
Dinophysis, notably regarding the regularity of the yearly maximum.
